{
    "title": "Muzz: Muslim Marriage & Social",
    "description": "Muzz is the United States biggest Muslim marriage and social app where Muslims can meet and mingle whether they are looking for marriage or friendship. With over 500,000 Muslim marriages and 500 new couples every day, we know Muzz works. As a Muslim matrimonial app, we\u2019ve included various features to help you meet your perfect Muslim partner in a safe and halal way. Just here to make friends? No problem, we have now launched Muzz Social which is a fun place to post and connect with the community! So, come and say Salams on Muzz.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc96Muzz is your destination for Muslim marriage, connecting you with 10 million single Muslims. Join a community where 500,000 Muslim marriages have already been celebrated and 500 new couples are formed daily.\r\n\ud83e\udea9On Muzz Social, you can express your thoughts and opinions, whether anonymously or openly. Participate in groups that match your interests and build new friendships. Start engaging with others by greeting them with a warm Salam!\r\n__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\r\n\u26a0\ufe0f SAFETY FEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2705 Verified Users: In addition to being verified with a selfie, we\u2019ve added an extra layer of security with ID Verification, to make sure you only talk to real single Muslims.\r\n\ud83d\udd10 Safety First: We have a dedicated team that is here to help you with your Muslim dating experience and provide assistance.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd78 Stay Private: You have complete control of who can see your profile and keep your photos private until you're ready to share them.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffb Chaperone: Need that extra peace of mind? Include a chaperone (or Wali) in your conversations.\r\n___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\r\n\ud83d\udcf2 WHY MUZZ?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Targeted Filters: Find your perfect match by Location, Interests, Profession, Ethnicity, Language, Education and much more. Explore other cultures, chat with Arabs, South Asian, European Muslims and more.\r\n\r\n\u260e\ufe0f Video & Voice: Get to know your matches beyond chat with video and voice calling, voice notes and profile videos.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddca Break The Ice: Let us help you start the conversation. Add three icebreaker questions to your profile, and we\u2019ll reveal your match\u2019s answer once you\u2019ve both connected.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc83 Let Your Personality Shine: Sometimes simply saying Salams \ud83d\udc4bor having a brief bio might not fully capture your story. Are you a cat person who loves to visit museums? We\u2019ve added Personality and Interest options to make your profile stand out.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e Connect Nationwide : Moved to the city but still looking for a Muslim partner back in your hometown? Use Travel Mode to explore places such as; California, Texas, Michigan and New York.\r\n____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\r\n\ud83d\udcdd HOW IT WORKS\r\n1. Simply sign up and create a profile\r\n2. Use good photos and write a bio letting other single Muslims know what you're looking for\r\n3. We'll show you compatible single Muslims near you who fit your filters and preferences\r\n4. Like them if you're interested, Pass on them if you're not\r\n5. You control who can speak to you. Once you like each other you can start chatting for free\r\n6. Take things to the next level with a voice or video call\r\n7. Complete the other half of your deen and get married!\r\nPrivacy https://muzz.com/privacy-policy\r\nTerms https://muzz.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Muzz is the United States biggest Muslim marriage and social app where Muslims can meet and mingle whether they are looking for marriage or friendship. With over 500,000 Muslim marriages and 500 new couples every day, we know Muzz works. As a Muslim matrimonial app, we\u2019ve included various features to help you meet your perfect Muslim partner in a safe and halal way. Just here to make friends? No problem, we have now launched Muzz Social which is a fun place to post and connect with the community! So, come and say Salams on Muzz.<br><br>\ud83d\udc96Muzz is your destination for Muslim marriage, connecting you with 10 million single Muslims. Join a community where 500,000 Muslim marriages have already been celebrated and 500 new couples are formed daily.<br>\ud83e\udea9On Muzz Social, you can express your thoughts and opinions, whether anonymously or openly. Participate in groups that match your interests and build new friendships. Start engaging with others by greeting them with a warm Salam!<br>__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br>\u26a0\ufe0f SAFETY FEATURES<br><br>\u2705 Verified Users: In addition to being verified with a selfie, we\u2019ve added an extra layer of security with ID Verification, to make sure you only talk to real single Muslims.<br>\ud83d\udd10 Safety First: We have a dedicated team that is here to help you with your Muslim dating experience and provide assistance.<br><br>\ud83e\udd78 Stay Private: You have complete control of who can see your profile and keep your photos private until you&#39;re ready to share them.<br><br>\ud83d\udc74\ud83c\udffb Chaperone: Need that extra peace of mind? Include a chaperone (or Wali) in your conversations.<br>___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br>\ud83d\udcf2 WHY MUZZ?<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d Targeted Filters: Find your perfect match by Location, Interests, Profession, Ethnicity, Language, Education and much more. Explore other cultures, chat with Arabs, South Asian, European Muslims and more.<br><br>\u260e\ufe0f Video &amp; Voice: Get to know your matches beyond chat with video and voice calling, voice notes and profile videos.<br><br>\ud83e\uddca Break The Ice: Let us help you start the conversation. Add three icebreaker questions to your profile, and we\u2019ll reveal your match\u2019s answer once you\u2019ve both connected.<br><br>\ud83d\udc83 Let Your Personality Shine: Sometimes simply saying Salams \ud83d\udc4bor having a brief bio might not fully capture your story. Are you a cat person who loves to visit museums? We\u2019ve added Personality and Interest options to make your profile stand out.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0e Connect Nationwide : Moved to the city but still looking for a Muslim partner back in your hometown? Use Travel Mode to explore places such as; California, Texas, Michigan and New York.<br>____________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________<br>\ud83d\udcdd HOW IT WORKS<br>1. Simply sign up and create a profile<br>2. Use good photos and write a bio letting other single Muslims know what you&#39;re looking for<br>3. We&#39;ll show you compatible single Muslims near you who fit your filters and preferences<br>4. Like them if you&#39;re interested, Pass on them if you&#39;re not<br>5. You control who can speak to you. Once you like each other you can start chatting for free<br>6. Take things to the next level with a voice or video call<br>7. Complete the other half of your deen and get married!<br>Privacy https://muzz.com/privacy-policy<br>Terms https://muzz.com/terms",
